{"text": "A Story.\n\nZara sits on the floor with Pip.\n\n\"Why can't you sleep?\" asks Pip.\n\n\"My head is busy,\" says Zara. \"I think and think.\"\n\n\"I try sheep,\" says Pip. \"Fifty sheep in one second. It is no good.\"\n\nZara laughs. \"Fifty? Pip, that is very fast!\"\n\nThen she looks at Pip. \"Do you want to sleep, too?\"\n\n\"Yes,\" says Pip. \"Very much. Every night.\"\n\nZara thinks. Then she smiles.\n\n\"Mum reads me a story. Then I sleep.\"\n\n\"Can I read you a story?\" asks Pip.\n\n\"Yes, please!\"\n\nThey go to Zara's room. Zara gets into bed. Pip puts the green blanket on her. It is the right size for Zara.\n\nOn the table, there are many books. Zara gives Pip a small blue book. It is new.\n\n\"This one, please,\" she says. \"It is about a robot.\"\n\nPip opens the book. He reads the first line.\n\n\"I tell you a story tonight.\"\n\nPip reads. He is slow and quiet.\n\nThe story is about a little robot. He lives in a yellow house. He tries sheep. He tries milk. His blanket is too small.\n\nZara laughs. \"He is like you, Pip!\"\n\nPip reads on. Page one, page two, page three.\n\nAt page ten, Zara's eyes close. She sleeps. She smiles in her sleep.\n\nPip stops. The room is warm and dark. The house is quiet.\n\nPip feels heavy. His lights go down. Blue, then grey, then dark.\n\nThen something new happens.\n\nPip sees a green hill. There are white sheep on the hill. One, two, three. They are very slow.\n\nOne sheep looks at Pip. \"Hello, Pip,\" it says.\n\nPip is not in Zara's room. He is in a dream!\n\nIn the morning, Zara opens her eyes. Pip is on the floor by her bed. His blue lights are on again.\n\n\"Pip! Do you sleep now?\"\n\n\"Yes,\" says Pip. \"And I dream. I dream about sheep.\"\n\nZara laughs. \"Fifty sheep?\"\n\n\"No. Only three. They are my friends.\"\n\nZara looks at the blue book. \"Pip, look at the name!\"\n\nIts name is Pip Cannot Sleep.\n\nPip looks at the book. Then he looks at you. Yes, you.\n\nDo you know me now? I am Pip. This is my story. I tell it to you tonight.\n\nAre you in bed? Is your blanket warm? Are your eyes tired?\n\nMe too.\n\nClose your eyes. Count the sheep. One, two, three.\n\nGood night.", "textSha256": "632cf018771f09da454f5bc0ddb93852098caed13602c39a676f4bdafcb3c71f", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.9, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["A", " ", "S", "t", "o", "r", "y", ".", "\n", "\n", "Z", "a", "r", "a", " ", "s", "i", "t", "s", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "l", "o", "o", "r", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "P", "i", "p", ".", "\n", "\n", "\"", "W", "h", "y", " ", "c", "a", "n", "'", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "s", "l", "e", "e", "p", "?", "\"", " ", "a", "s", "k", "s", " ", "P", "i", "p", ".", "\n", "\n", "\"", "M", "y", " ", "h", "e", "a", "d", " ", "i", "s", " ", "b", "u", "s", "y", ",", "\"", " ", "s", "a", "y", "s", " ", "Z", "a", "r", "a", ".", " ", "\"", "I", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", ".", "\"", "\n", "\n", "\"", "I", " ", "t", "r", "y", " ", "s", "h", "e", "e", "p", ",", "\"", " ", "s", "a", "y", "s", " ", "P", "i", "p", ".", " ", "\"", "F", "i", "f", "t", "y", " ", "s", "h", "e", "e", "p", " ", "i", "n", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "s", "e", "c", "o", "n", "d", ".", " ", "I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", " ", "g", "o", "o", "d", ".", "\"", "\n", "\n", "Z", "a", "r", "a", " ", "l", "a", "u", "g", "h", "s", ".", " ", "\"", "F", "i", "f", "t", "y", "?", " ", "P", "i", "p", ",", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "f", "a", "s", "t", "!", "\"", "\n", "\n", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "s", " ", "a", "t", " ", "P", "i", "p", ".", " ", "\"", "D", "o", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "l", "e", "e", "p", ",", " ", "t", "o", "o", "?", "\"", "\n", "\n", "\"", "Y", "e", "s", ",", "\"", " ", "s", "a", "y", "s", " ", "P", "i", "p", ".